      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Is milking the cows in the barnyard of a farm he has rebuilt, and does not yet know who is on the prairie behind him.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "wizard-of-oz-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
